OL,3,AEven Grand Theft Auto's original
OL,4,Acreators haven't been able to play GTA
OL,5,A6
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter a 13-year wait, two delays, and
OL,8,Fseveral high-profile leaks, the launch
OL,9,Fof Grand Theft Auto 6 is fast
OL,10,Fapproaching.
OL,12,FThe next chapter in the nearly
OL,13,F30-year-old series, where players
OL,14,Fexplore open worlds and break the law,
OL,15,Fhas created an extraordinary level of
OL,16,Fanticipation.
OL,18,FAnd with developer Rockstar Games
OL,19,Fkeeping their biggest release yet,
OL,20,Ftightly under wraps, even the people
OL,21,Fwho helped bring the original to life
OL,22,Faren't getting special treatment.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
