OL,3,AEven Grand Theft Auto's original
OL,4,Acreators haven't been able to play GTA
OL,5,A6
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We're all waiting to see what they've
OL,8,Fdone," Dave Jones, GTA's co-creator,
OL,9,Ftells me, sitting alongside the
OL,10,Foriginal game's writer and publicist,
OL,11,FBrian Baglow.
